---

## Critical ones explained

**`.env`** — most important. This file will contain API keys, database URLs, secrets. Never push it. Instead push a `.env.example` like this:
```
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./data/frauddb.sqlite
CHROMADB_PATH=./data/chromadb
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
LOG_LEVEL=INFO